# Generated code is checked with the program. A problem in it is reported at the line the generator named with
# `# sake-origin: FILE:LINE` (here a line of the table or of the template), with the generated line in a hint.
generate "lib/gen/records", "lib/gen/records_bad.txt"
generate "lib/gen/template", "lib/gen/hello_bad.txt"

puts render_hello_bad(User.new("ko1", 25))
